name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","review_id":"-9Hx2FRO2gDxi8vxgSYQ9Q","date":"2018-06-17T02:49:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9366062879562378,"text_excerpt":"Great food and great service. A group of us came here for dinner after the suggestion of a friend. We were greeted and seated right away. The owner, Danny, came to greet us after we were seated. We had a small bowl of gumbo to start. The gumbo was fantastic, it was light and flavorful. We also tried the crab cakes which were very tasty and moist. For the entree, I had the shrimp carbonara. The portion size was just right and the shrimp and pasta had just the right amount of kick. Michael, the server, checked on us frequently. I'll definitely be coming back to Cava to try out the different offerings on their menu."},{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","review_id":"aLXzkrKUu0aoW4PEQsFmvA","date":"2016-04-26T02:04:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9291126132011414,"text_excerpt":"I have been to Cava six times since it opened. The food has always been good but the dinner we had Saturday evening was over the top. There were 8 of us so I got to taste a few dishes other than mine. I started with an appetizer of four beautifully fried oysters on a bed of lightly creamed spinach and bacon lardons on top. Delicious! My entree was the pork Osso Bucco. The eye appeal, tenderness and taste were unmatched. My wife had the red snapper \" en pappiette\" (I can't spell it. It was in a bag). The presentation was fantastic and the taste with the vegetables in the sauce was awesome. One guest had a huge fried soft shell crab that was fantastic. No one in the city had a better meal t..."},{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","review_id":"1yqIBq-dZMVbnCi36yOgMw","date":"2016-05-18T02:11:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9194414615631104,"text_excerpt":"Our first time here. It was awesome! Passed this place on Harrison Ave several times. Noticed the great looking interior decor and wanted to try. The food matched the decor - it was great! Another reviewer called Cava a hidden gem and I couldn't agree more. We had crab claws for an appetizer. So tasty! Save some of your bread to soak up the sauce. For entrees I had the crawfish linguine and my wife had Osso Buco. Both were amazing! We will be back to this neighborhood gem for sure."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","photo_id":"WQNxBhCJsgktqOHggNaWBQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WQNxBhCJsgktqOHggNaWBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9130019545555115},{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","photo_id":"7GRlAqp0LL2Dnt-GtFsb8Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7GRlAqp0LL2Dnt-GtFsb8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8368402123451233},{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","photo_id":"IyC2Kd5kokoJbQeftNM7eA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/IyC2Kd5kokoJbQeftNM7eA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8314207792282104},{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","photo_id":"bTde4KZquw0SCN1BI2CNnQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bTde4KZquw0SCN1BI2CNnQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8200936317443848},{"business_id":"aYTy7BprrbZ2uvsqPHanZg","photo_id":"dKrAvboXY3Ln5v23mqknvg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dKrAvboXY3Ln5v23mqknvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8141583204269409}]},"notebook_case":null}
